<title>THAILAND: Thai Nov foreign reserves fall to US$39.6 bln.</title>
<headline>Thai Nov foreign reserves fall to US$39.6 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's foreign reserves fell in November to US$39.6 billion from $39.9 billion in October, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    THAI FOREIGN RESERVES     Nov 96     Oct 96     Nov 95</p>
<p>					 39.6	 39.9	 36.2</p>
<p>Note - The Bank of Thailand said figures are in U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 252-9950</p>
</text>
